WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
A six-digit odometer
has six number wheels.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.900
Each wheel carries into
the next after nine.

00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:07.600
At the maximum, all
six wheels show nine.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:10.233
One more mile carries
through all six wheels.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.233
The display returns to zero.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:14.033
The car did not become new.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.400
The counter simply
ran out of digits.
